@startuml state_parser_plugin
title Plugin packet parser (KSPSerialPort.ReceivedDataEvent)

[*] --> FIRSTHEADER

FIRSTHEADER --> SECONDHEADER : byte == 0xBE
FIRSTHEADER --> FIRSTHEADER : any other byte (discarded)

SECONDHEADER --> SIZE : byte == 0xEF
SECONDHEADER --> FIRSTHEADER : any other byte

SIZE --> PAYLOAD : size > 0\nCurrentBytesRead = 0
SIZE --> FIRSTHEADER : size == 0 (invalid, resync)

PAYLOAD --> PAYLOAD : store byte in PayloadBuffer
PAYLOAD --> CS : CurrentBytesRead >= size

CS --> FIRSTHEADER : checksum good:\ncopy to NewPacketBuffer,\nNewPacketFlag = true
CS --> FIRSTHEADER : checksum bad:\npacket dropped
@enduml
